# QA and review artifacts: screenshots, reports and recordings belong in the private repo, not
# in the published source tree. Kept as a pattern rather than one path so the next one does not
# ride in on a `git add -A` the way qa-evidence-epic-159 did.
qa-evidence-*/

# The repository's own documents are the only things that belong at the root.
# Anything else there is a local working file - drafts, notes, exports - and an
# allowlist keeps a wide `git add` from sweeping them into the published tree.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/RELEASING.md
!/SECURITY.md
/*.png
!/lumenwipe.png
